    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lullapops Sail Race</i></strong><i> is an exciting sailing and motorboat racing 3D physics game where you compete against autopilot controlled boats\u00a0 in dynamic waters. Choose your skipper or\u00a0 steer your boat\u00a0 through red-green gates to victory! Experience realistic wind mechanics, master sailing strategies like tacking, or speed through the course in motorboat mode. Create custom race routes, adjust weather conditions, and challenge yourself to become the ultimate champion. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lullapops Sail Race</i></strong><i> is an exciting sailing and motorboat racing 3D physics game where you compete against autopilot controlled boats\u00a0 in dynamic waters. Choose your skipper or\u00a0 steer your boat\u00a0 through red-green gates to victory! Experience realistic wind mechanics, master sailing strategies like tacking, or speed through the course in motorboat mode. Create custom race routes, adjust weather conditions, and challenge yourself to become the ultimate champion. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
